  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Rigor + load">Emit RIGOR LEVEL (FULL). Read the existing H13E2EAcceptanceGateHandler.cs aggregation scaffolding (if any) plus spec.md's FR-18 acceptance language in full.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Inventory checks">Enumerate all 15 constituent checks (11 probes + 3 runners + Ready-writer trigger condition) and confirm each is wired to the REAL implementation from tasks 170-184, not a leftover Placeholder reference.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Aggregation logic">Implement (or fix) the strict-AND composite decision: Completed/Ready fires only if all 15 checks Pass; any Fail produces a non-Ready outcome with itemized per-check results in the run's ErrorDetail / logs.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Itemized reporting">Ensure the aggregation's failure output names WHICH check(s) failed (operator-actionable), not a bare aggregate Fail.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Comprehensive tests">Author a test matrix: all-pass -&gt; Ready; each single-check-fails-rest-pass permutation -&gt; non-Ready with that check correctly identified; multiple-simultaneous-fails -&gt; non-Ready with all failing checks identified.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Placeholder sweep">grep the ENTIRE E2EAcceptanceModule.cs + H13 handler for any remaining Placeholder*/Null*/Stub* registration -- confirm ZERO remain.</step>
    <step order="6" name="Build + verify">dotnet build 0 errors; dotnet test green.</step>
  </steps>

  <escalation>
