    <criterion testable="true">A test matrix confirms EACH single-check-fails-rest-pass permutation (at least a representative sample across traps, invariants, and runners) produces a non-Ready outcome with that specific check correctly identified in the failure report.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A test confirms a multiple-simultaneous-failure scenario reports ALL failing checks, not just the first one encountered.</criterion>
