  <notes>Justification (CLAUDE.md §11): Existing -- the individual probe/runner/writer implementations (tasks 170-184) already exist by the time this task runs; this task's job is purely the composition logic binding them together correctly. Extension -- N/A, this IS the extension point the whole wave has been building toward. Cost-of-doing-nothing -- without correct aggregation, even a suite of 15 individually-correct checks could still produce a false Ready (a masking bug) or an unnecessarily-blocked Fail (a false negative) -- either failure mode defeats the entire purpose of Wave G-7's investment in real probes.</notes>

